      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator is at high risk. 
As of the mission date, the president and members have still not been appointed, and the Council has therefore issued no decisions to date. Nominations are expected to be submitted to the Council of Ministers in March or April 2026. With approximately 20 months remaining before program close, the timeline to reach the target of three decisions is tight and will require prompt appointment of Council members followed by rapid operationalization. The World Bank team is engaging with the Ministry of Economy to accelerate this process, with full operationalization committed by December 31, 2026.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="0"></actual>
